{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_237bb214a120db62f18f37f0ce3d8441c4cc38d3d4e8f5ee302771f8ef008b9f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"aeonfun/aeon@95142d19705c snapshot 76226e8365f601b0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_55786f8fd059eac1d5a7bad21a6cc6bac1d16efcdd0401c0ad3a23428c855dca"],"source_ids":["src_19bc9bacb4c45f59996178d8d573d3cf"],"text":"The ADK auth pattern uses three credentials: a user OAuth token (no scope param, since permissions come from the App definition), an App JWT used only to mint installation tokens, and a ~1h installation token scoped to one installation's repos.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2ed9ba23f17ddc20849fc9047515cdcffbdec3b18bc9ce8f93ff7a408afade1b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"aeonfun/aeon@95142d19705c snapshot 76226e8365f601b0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_54fb63ea5639ed50587ba736f8dbb9076e31da862b2b6578a9818509a1567e4c","slc_ae0b7b4a2979703a460015418f753c28dd3c538cb97bd135d5a438e558187981"],"source_ids":["src_19bc9bacb4c45f59996178d8d573d3cf"],"text":"On-demand skill runs go through a single aeon.yml workflow accepting workflow_dispatch inputs: skill (required, regex-checked), var, model (must match a choice option or GitHub returns 422), and harness (claude default or grok).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4b0dd74d164e45d121a5fc9927ef055d5f5eb5c77446f71deab2b378e39722fc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"aeonfun/aeon@95142d19705c snapshot 76226e8365f601b0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_538f1a5771cd7a7aa513c1cf9df389119ee346f9df630be970a7c3b3c2e002e7","slc_cc72764a796b889d06fe548ce131943bc2babdc26fc25e0e24b8740f924bd221","slc_e3841f942e50f76b082dd9ff6f9500bdd661d4e4291e69eb7003e64cf3387d7c"],"source_ids":["src_19bc9bacb4c45f59996178d8d573d3cf"],"text":"catalog/skills.json is the machine-readable skill catalog; each entry carries a slug, description, category, a single universal var input, required env keys, and needed MCP servers.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5f001f6525c45d78b17de8657799f68ad39f813c06aa0aaee070352d0a4218e2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"aeonfun/aeon@95142d19705c snapshot 76226e8365f601b0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_cd19ce0c31169a84abc6a7f8d3264e5902d9000d6a528d011211d3316ff1df98"],"source_ids":["src_43f416c435675cc0bb524b093a7f79ba"],"text":"If no OS sandbox is available, run-harness warns that read-only is advisory on stderr and only the tool-allowlist and post-run layers apply; CI installs bubblewrap explicitly to avoid silent downgrade.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_76aaf847bf733c892162aade675cab31d8c0e6edc7873c64ec95b14ee3c8d206","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"aeonfun/aeon@95142d19705c snapshot 76226e8365f601b0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9d71041be1f8e8b911544f15d02c0dccde87977b437f38fb043985c71608844f"],"source_ids":["src_c9a609665f5a5c32be294059aa11ef70"],"text":"The ./notify tool writes a structured JSON payload to a queue, and a post-run scripts/notify-deliver.sh is the only place channel tokens are consumed, rendering per channel (Telegram, Discord, Slack, Buzz) with per-send audit lines.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8317142fd9228a982dcdfe7b990c2471db09c8c05f0be94eb28f83076f04b871","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"aeonfun/aeon@95142d19705c snapshot 76226e8365f601b0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8714e17a3b576eadf393a33030ac416de917b83ff43beadf75b70157aeb36f01"],"source_ids":["src_19bc9bacb4c45f59996178d8d573d3cf"],"text":"The ADK recommends a GitHub App over personal access tokens: no credential custody, least-privilege fixed permissions, instant revocation on uninstall, and free multi-tenancy since GitHub tracks installations.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_84bbdb21091952122b79b586d18a485f7c850aaeda3a11a5605ebbb28fef2d89","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"aeonfun/aeon@95142d19705c snapshot 76226e8365f601b0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1d94cf8a5951cbdedfbb39a311e5ae960819ecd47713750e747ed26099ef6069"],"source_ids":["src_19bc9bacb4c45f59996178d8d573d3cf"],"text":"Repository development practice: pack authors can pre-flight locally with scripts/validate-pack.sh from an Aeon checkout, and listing requires a PR adding a README Community Packs row plus a catalog/skill-packs.json entry.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8524fb1b262679e3fac671019cd367fd0d69680faf901154f15bf6ce77e7f856","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"aeonfun/aeon@95142d19705c snapshot 76226e8365f601b0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2458688d8feced19a69174d4e90b114119d9d8f96ea181ce99a635912373e7dc","slc_cc0d550af34049c71b79ad99b7c73481df384be226d82f5ff6c14289c444ddc0"],"source_ids":["src_19bc9bacb4c45f59996178d8d573d3cf"],"text":"A skill is a single Markdown file with frontmatter (name, description, category, requires, var, mode) plus a prompt; there is no plugin API or compilation step.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_873544ab4ac9bced1a9d81bc9e86088baf051f80e0ec65b1cd1d6f5f59c9bfd2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"aeonfun/aeon@95142d19705c snapshot 76226e8365f601b0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_10feecc02ebf74b3259732ddbb265731cc65f230851d0ab806c979558a5ad7d5","slc_e2b2f2cc062d3d2d0111f4d30e05f15291806475b999c85a08c7fe6ce0e26ed7"],"source_ids":["src_19bc9bacb4c45f59996178d8d573d3cf"],"text":"Tenant isolation requires re-verifying with the user's token on every request that they still have access to the stored installation/repo, because otherwise any authenticated user could drive someone else's agent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_94152b4b1bee22d28bb277eaf4cc2b6954eeecca1001e294cf3ad36d73464262","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"aeonfun/aeon@95142d19705c snapshot 76226e8365f601b0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ef69c5f7a1552ec06ffbf0eb18c193937733a1aa6699facfcb02c77fe41e5d2e"],"source_ids":["src_c9a609665f5a5c32be294059aa11ef70"],"text":"Aeon dispatches to ten coding-agent CLIs via a run-harness contract, including Cursor, Hermes, GLM, and Vercel's fx, with credentials surfaced as dashboard Access Keys rows.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_958577e6bdd5a79ee293e4b5ac5a4b97ce478b15ed4400cb55691640eb4c6879","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"aeonfun/aeon@95142d19705c snapshot 76226e8365f601b0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0e168f6dbf7f74d63d4bdb6366f463b0eed032cd59baea9b1dd0c433ccc69512","slc_1441b87acdba436668b3ab6a0c6624ac2039e2bbff1bcde8dcf98106a7696e01","slc_5448d0a51a951f53e6175da7b6a175ef66e3818930cf1513a19627c8f16180de","slc_848d60b5bd748415b2f09084db81464b5b748ab5b458d416822dbb48045273a8"],"source_ids":["src_43f416c435675cc0bb524b093a7f79ba"],"text":"The one runtime-enforced axis is the SKILL.md mode tier: read-only mode strips write tools, mounts the repo read-only via an OS sandbox (bwrap on Linux, sandbox-exec on macOS) across all nine harnesses, and a post-run guard reverts stray writes.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9a8da15adaa4c4cf4254aec05b68ff86678c6f4557b33f58641dd211e3af2c14","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"aeonfun/aeon@95142d19705c snapshot 76226e8365f601b0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7cd8f0339d3921b505328974abdb2601915d32e2b7869b71789d5ebac0ab0b91"],"source_ids":["src_19bc9bacb4c45f59996178d8d573d3cf"],"text":"The instance needs at least one model credential (CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, or an LLM gateway key), resolved by prefix with auto-cascading.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_dca220d4e9a1e4aa481d33e90b5d416ee54dcf72048b5889e9c26f6ff669613a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"aeonfun/aeon@95142d19705c snapshot 76226e8365f601b0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1913ccfd9786aee54dc252ec701f6c1075e749aa2e3b3c4e889874a6b8e3a806","slc_2b61325ba173b3bbbc9eb73b889148b7010f68c0e0837476af3109a723c642b1"],"source_ids":["src_19bc9bacb4c45f59996178d8d573d3cf"],"text":"An Aeon instance is a GitHub repo plus GitHub Actions with no Aeon server or API; integrators read/write files and dispatch workflows via GitHub APIs such as Contents, Actions Secrets, and workflow_dispatch.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ebab8a19ea9bb1f24897b6cc00b85303329a790a21b4e4e24c1d0ee80829faf3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"aeonfun/aeon@95142d19705c snapshot 76226e8365f601b0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2ace1411593f6224941b0410df360668593900fd826c72b84803df954ef106e5"],"source_ids":["src_19bc9bacb4c45f59996178d8d573d3cf"],"text":"GitHub delivers only about 10% of 5-minute schedule ticks; the scheduler also accepts repository_dispatch type cron-tick so a backend can act as an uptime pinger, with a debt model preventing double-firing.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f5eea402cf66e85fe3a35855ce71c966c67f9fdaa4800195c1a8b7b05e6607d5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"aeonfun/aeon@95142d19705c snapshot 76226e8365f601b0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_364f2009e75d987f23287dfd4f5c7e77463f1e399a2d4a67da2e17ae7d4d54a3","slc_4e445945155e7bb1d41f5d6f50409787bfb3794da03f344a52d5bd6e50109cf3"],"source_ids":["src_19bc9bacb4c45f59996178d8d573d3cf"],"text":"Skill packs are published in their own repo with a skills-pack.json manifest; the installer security-scans each SKILL.md, records provenance in skills.lock, and registers skills disabled so the operator remains the trust boundary.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f6fc7f6df588f8bc53d7c4170a8ab700d8eac9ddbb51ffb0996592c12c5f6268","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"aeonfun/aeon@95142d19705c snapshot 76226e8365f601b0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_419a4795770814033900f2cece8db9831a167dc906e1268819d3ed44cf0b17fc","slc_c2701f578fa73a7a8a2e99c70296658028f325e34271afda8271eab71157568a"],"source_ids":["src_43f416c435675cc0bb524b093a7f79ba"],"text":"Repository development practice: adding a new capability value requires one PR updating the taxonomy doc, the schema reference, and the install-skill-pack allow-list constant, enforced by a ci-capabilities-parity workflow that fails when the three disagree.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a7ff5177c808486eb94ae3877caa7aae"}
